{"id":"807d3e2825b947af","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-hintikka-formula.md","title":"Hintikka Formula Set","display":"df-hintikka-formula — Hintikka Formula Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-hintikka-formula","aliases":["57-df-hintikka-formula"],"display":"df-hintikka-formula — Hintikka Formula Set","depends_on":["[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-literal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-hintikka-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-hintikka-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hintikka-formula — Hintikka Formula Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 与逻辑构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hintikka}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hintikka}\\)</span> 保留原四项闭包条件，不擅自加入量词或负合取的其他条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NNF}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NNF}_S\\)</span> 是以下有限递归给出的无量词否定范式类，供模型存在条目说明适用片段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nH\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\ \\neg(p\\in H\\land\\neg p\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ (\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\land\\psi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\lor\\psi\\in H)],\\\\\nN_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq N_k\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\varphi\\lor\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in N_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NNF}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}N_k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nH\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\ \\neg(p\\in H\\land\\neg p\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ (\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\land\\psi\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\lor\\psi\\in H)],\\\\\nN_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq N_k\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\varphi\\lor\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in N_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NNF}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}N_k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原式中的自由元变量量化。四项条件本身不足以保证任意一阶公式集有模型，例如它们没有处理负合取、量词或等号一致性；相应定理须限制片段或另列条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 与逻辑构造子见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Hintikka}$ 保留原四项闭包条件，不擅自加入量词或负合取的其他条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 与逻辑构造子见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Hintikka}$ 保留原四项闭包条件，不擅自加入量词或负合取的其他条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lit}_S$ 见 [[57-df-literal]]；$\\mathrm{NNF}_S$ 是以下有限递归给出的无量词否定范式类，供模型存在条目说明适用片段。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hintikka}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NNF}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nH\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}\\longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\ \\neg(p\\in H\\land\\neg p\\in H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ (\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\land\\psi\\in H)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in H\\to\\varphi\\in H\\lor\\psi\\in H)],\\\\\nN_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nN_{k+1}&\\coloneqq N_k\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\varphi\\lor\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in N_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{NNF}_S&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}N_k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1538,"backlinks":[{"id":"8216982d66b31a60","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f985ced977f087d9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言，$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\emptyset$。$\\Theta\\in\\mathrm{Hintikka}$ 使用 [[57-df-hintikka-formula]] 的原四条件。$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{NNF}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，且其中出现的所有原子子公式均为关系原子 $R(\\vec t)$，不出现等号原子；因此它们是无量词、闭的、无等号的否定范式。$\\mathrm{Sf}$ 见 [[57-df-subformula]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[5